# the pieces: PRESETS through all eight and round; each keeps what's changed on it; GLO held saves; a reboot brings
# them back as they were left; GLO held on, a piece back to its recipe
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect playing 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
expect piece 1
turn PRESET 6
wait 300
expect piece 7
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
expect piece 0
# piece 0's Sequence Length to 12, then to piece 2 and back: kept
tap ARP
wait 300
spin K3 4
wait 300
expect par28 12
turn PRESET 2
wait 300
expect piece 2
expect par28 8
turn PRESET -2
wait 300
expect par28 12
# saved (GLO held half a second), the flash read back at boot
press GLO
wait 700
release GLO
wait 300
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 5
expect piece 0
expect par28 12
# GLO held on (1.5 s): back to its recipe
press GLO
wait 1700
release GLO
wait 300
expect par28 8
